\ @ID 12
\ @TITLE OBSIDIAN CANON
\ @SUBTITLE 10.24.54 · 4-VOICE DIATONIC CANON
\ @CATEGORY MATH-SYNTH
\ @PARTS 3
\ @PART 1 2-Voice Canon
\ @PART 2 3-Voice Canon
\ @PART 3 4-Voice Full Canon
\ @SPEED 1.85
\ @FORMULA y1=bass, y2=diat(2*t2 - q), y3=1+diat(2*t4 - (q-2))/12

VARIABLE OC-Q  VARIABLE OC-M2  VARIABLE OC-X
VARIABLE OC-Y1  VARIABLE OC-Y2  VARIABLE OC-Y3  VARIABLE OC-Y4

: TRACK-EVAL ( x part -- )
  SWAP DUP OC-X !
  DUP 4.0 / FLOOR >INT OC-Q !
  DUP 2.0 * FLOOR >INT 8 IMOD OC-M2 !

  2 12 OC-Q @ 2 + I* - 7 I/
  OC-M2 @ 3 >= IF 7 + THEN
  OC-M2 @ 6 >= IF 5 + THEN F16 12.0 / 1.0 - OC-Y1 !

  DUP 4.0 * FLOOR >INT 2 I* 4 + 5 IMOD 2 I* OC-Q @ 2 - 7 IMOD - DIAT F16 12.0 / 1.0 + OC-Y3 !

  DUP 2.0 * FLOOR >INT 1 + 3 IMOD 2 I* OC-Q @ 7 IMOD - DIAT F16 12.0 / OC-Y2 !
  0.5 - DUP 4.0 / FLOOR >INT SWAP FLOOR >INT 4 IMOD 2 MIN + 6 SWAP - DIAT F16 12.0 / OC-Y4 !

  CASE
    0 OF 2 VOICES-N! OC-Y1 @ 0 PRIM-TRI  OC-Y2 @ 1 PRIM-SINE ENDOF
    1 OF 3 VOICES-N! OC-Y1 @ 0 PRIM-TRI  OC-Y2 @ 1 PRIM-SINE  OC-Y3 @ 2 PRIM-SAW ENDOF
    4 VOICES-N! OC-Y1 @ 0 PRIM-TRI  OC-Y2 @ 1 PRIM-SINE  OC-Y4 @ 2 PRIM-TRI  OC-Y3 @ 3 PRIM-SAW
  ENDCASE ;
